# Chrome API Usage

## Storage

- Use `chrome.storage.local` only — never `sync` or `session`
- Document new keys in `docs/STORAGE.md`
- Set install defaults in `background.js` `onInstalled`
- Keys: camelCase (`scrollSpeed`, `cachedEmails`, `collectionState`)

## Messaging

- Action strings: camelCase (`collectEmails`, `updateSearchInput`)
- Register new actions in sender AND receiver
- Update `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` message registry

## Tabs

- Query active tab: `chrome.tabs.query({ active: true, currentWindow: true })`
- Remove `onUpdated` listeners after use (15s timeout pattern)
- Track collection tab via `activeCollectionTabId` in storage

## Permissions

- Request minimum permissions in `manifest.json`
- Document justification in `docs/MANIFEST.md` and `docs/PRIVACY_AND_SECURITY.md`
- Do not add permissions without explicit need

## Scripting

- Re-inject content script before messaging if injection may have failed
- Target specific `tabId`, never inject into arbitrary URLs
